# Marketing skills installed per-session with
#   npx skills add coreyhaines31/marketingskills -a claude-code
# Deliberately not vendored: they are third-party instructions that run with
# full agent permissions, and pinning 3 MB of them in this repo would make the
# static site's history about someone else's tooling.
.claude/
skills-lock.json

# Node
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*

# OS / editor cruft
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
